{"pull": {"id": "number:15968", "number": 15968, "title": "KAFKA-10551: Add topic id support to produce request and response", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2024-05-15T15:53:10Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-29T22:37:28Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-29T22:37:28Z", "user": {"login": "OmniaGM", "id": 1101183, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExMDExODM=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1101183?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM", "html_url": "https://github.com/OmniaGM", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OmniaGM/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "- Add support topicId in `ProduceRequest`/`ProduceResponse`. Topic name\nand Topic Id will become `ignorable` following the footstep of\n`FetchRequest`/`FetchResponse`\n- ReplicaManager still look for `HostedPartition` using `TopicPartition`\nand doesn't check topic id. This is an **[OPEN QUESTION]** if we should\naddress this in this pr or wait for\n[KAFKA-16212](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16212) as this\nwill update `ReplicaManager::getPartition` to use `TopicIdParittion`\nonce we update the cache. Other option is that we compare provided\n`topicId` with `Partition` topic id and return `UNKNOW_TOPIC_ID` or\n`UNKNOW_TOPIC_PARTITION` if we can't find partition with matched topic\nid.\n\nReviewers: Jun Rao <jun@confluent.io>,